untry  if only for samples wednesday the 29th  of august  the captain major and the other captains  agreed that in as much as we had  discovered the country that we had come  in search of  as also spices and precious stones and  it appeared  impossible to establish cordial  relations with the people  it would be as well to take our  departure  and it was resolved that we should take  with us the men whom we detained  as on our return to calcutta they might  be useful to us  in establishing friendly relations we  therefore set sail and left for portugal  greatly rejoicing at our good fortune  and having made so great a discovery  [Music]  you

